        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s1_side02_0020_camera_02",
      "hash64": "91148DA99DBDF37B",
      "text": "Echt nicht? Aber wenigstens ein paar Fotos...?[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s1_side02_0020_camera_03",
      "hash64": "91148CA99DBDF1C8",
      "text": "Juhu! Dann mal auf Position![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s1_side02_0020_camera_04",
      "hash64": "911493A99DBDFDAD",
      "text": "Ich bin zwar nicht besonders stark, aber auf einen\\nguten Kampf!\\c\\nDiese Fotogelegenheit lass ich mir auf keinen Fall\\nentgehen.[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 127,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s1_side02_0020_camera_05",
      "hash64": "911492A99DBDFBFA",
      "text": "Du bist echt der Wahnsinn! Mir sind ein paar tolle\\nSchnappschüsse gelungen![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s1_side02_0020_camera_06",
      "hash64": "911491A99DBDFA47",
      "text": "Ich denke, du kannst es auf jeden Fall mit\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Blutmond[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] aufnehmen.[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
